# License and Third-Party Code Notice

This repository is a mixed-origin project. **There is currently no single, blanket open-source license for the entire repository.** Do not assume that every file or every section of the combined userscripts may be redistributed under one license.

This notice records the upstream sources and licensing information that can currently be established. It does not replace, narrow, or revoke rights granted by the original authors of third-party material.

## 1. Components with identified upstream GPL licensing

### Steam historical-lowest-price functionality

The wishlist historical-price functionality is based in part on:

- Upstream: [Steam 史低自动查询 (GreasyFork #586080)](https://greasyfork.org/zh-CN/scripts/586080-steam-%E5%8F%B2%E4%BD%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2-%E6%84%BF%E6%9C%9B%E5%8D%95-%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A5%E5%9C%9F%E7%BE%8E-%E5%8D%95%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E9%A1%B5-%E4%B8%AD-%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%94%B5%E8%84%91%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8)
- Upstream license: **GNU GPL version 3 or any later version (GPL-3.0-or-later)**, as identified on the upstream script page.

The original copyright and license notices for this component must be preserved. Modifications and derivative distributions must comply with the applicable GPL terms.

### Bundle-history indicator functionality

The bundle-history indicator is based in part on the Barter.vg bundle-data and game-card marking functionality from:

- Upstream: [Steam Family Game Analysis (GreasyFork #588235)](https://greasyfork.org/zh-CN/scripts/588235-steam-family-game-analysis-publishable)
- Upstream license: **GPLv3**, as identified by the upstream script.

The original copyright and license notices for this component must be preserved. Modifications and derivative distributions must comply with the applicable GPLv3 terms.

## 2. Recovered Chrome extension source code; license not yet established

The following two Chrome extensions are the upstream products. Their extension packages were unpacked for code-provenance comparison, and personal backup copies of the unpacked files are stored in [WuLinLee/back](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back). **That repository is maintained as a personal backup by this repository maintainer; it is not an official source-code repository, original distribution channel, or rights-holder statement for either extension.**

### HLTB for Steam

- Extension listing: [HLTB for Steam (Chrome Web Store)](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/hltb-for-steam/hcfnndjmgbpndcninokmfmlblngabgap)
- Version represented by the personal backup: **1.1.8**
- Personal unpacked backup copy: [back/1.1.8_0](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/tree/main/1.1.8_0)
- Relevant files: [content.js](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/blob/main/1.1.8_0/content.js), [background.js](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/blob/main/1.1.8_0/background.js), [lib/hltb-client.js](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/blob/main/1.1.8_0/lib/hltb-client.js), [lib/matcher.js](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/blob/main/1.1.8_0/lib/matcher.js), and [lib/cache.js](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/blob/main/1.1.8_0/lib/cache.js).

The HLTB integration in this repository has corresponding implementation for HLTB search, endpoint/auth handling, result matching, caching, and display. The userscript adapts and combines that functionality for the userscript environment.

### PY查价助手

- Extension listing: [PY查价助手 (Chrome Web Store)](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/py%E6%9F%A5%E4%BB%B7%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%8B/aeapdkmgpgihkiebomafllebjbjpmfok)
- Version represented by the personal backup: **1.0**
- Personal unpacked backup copy: [back/1.0_0](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/tree/main/1.0_0)
- Relevant files: [content.js](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/blob/main/1.0_0/content.js) and [background.js](https://github.com/WuLinLee/back/blob/main/1.0_0/background.js).

The SteamPy integration has corresponding implementation for Steam package lookup, SteamPy price requests, game-name fallback search, and wishlist price display. The userscript adapts the request mechanism to use the userscript manager's request API.

**Important licensing limitation:** `WuLinLee/back` is only a personal backup of unpacked extension packages. It is not operated by the extension authors and does not establish who owns the original code or what license the authors grant. No LICENSE file or explicit license grant for either extension was found alongside the backed-up files. The existence of an unpacked copy in this backup repository does not create permission to relicense, redistribute, or commercially use the extension code. The applicable terms must come from the original extension authors or another verifiable rights holder.

Until the original extension authors' licensing terms or permission are verified, this notice does not grant permission to redistribute, relicense, or commercially use those third-party components. Check the original source, license file, author statements, or obtain permission from the relevant rights holder before redistributing them.

